      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18358664214611053
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "It is stated by the learned counsel for the petitioner that respondent No. 2 has apportioned compensation in violation of the act and also in violation of Article 14 of the Constitution of India.",
