      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23101328313350677
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "Issue notice to the respondents, which is waived by Ms. Monika Kohli, learned Sr. AAG on behalf of respondent nos. 1 and 2 and Mr. Sunny Mahajan, Advocate for respondent no. 3.",
